The contrast is sharpening: OpenCode deliberately keeps a tiny environment block but adds nested, file-local instruction discovery during the turn; PI spends much more of the fixed prefix on its own documentation and duplicates custom tool prose into both prompt text and provider tool definitions. I’m validating the accounting and cache breakpoints before writing the harvest ranking.
